[00:15.00]I've been alone with you inside my mind
[00:15.00:zh]你常驻我脑海，伴我独自沉思
[00:23.00]And in my dreams I've kissed your lips a thousand times
[00:23.00:zh]梦里，我曾千百次亲吻你的唇
[00:31.00]I sometimes see you pass outside my door
[00:31.00:zh]偶尔看见你从我门前走过
[00:38.00]Hello  is it me you're looking for
[00:38.00:zh]你好，你寻觅的人，是我吗
[00:46.00]I can see it in your eyes
[00:46.00:zh]我能从你的眼眸察觉
[00:49.00]I can see it in your smile
[00:49.00:zh]我能从你的笑容看出
[00:54.00]You're all I've ever wanted  (and) my arms are open wide
[00:54.00:zh]你是我毕生所求，我已张开双臂
[01:01.00]'Cause you know just what to say
[01:01.00:zh]因为你总懂该如何言语
[01:05.00]And you know just what to do
[01:05.00:zh]你也明白该如何行动
[01:09.00]And I want to tell you so much  I love you
[01:09.00:zh]千言万语只想对你说：我爱你
[01:31.00]I long to see the sunlight in your hair
[01:31.00:zh]我渴望看见阳光洒落在你的发丝
[01:38.00]And tell you time and time again how much I care
[01:38.00:zh]一遍又一遍向你诉说我的牵挂
[01:46.00]Sometimes I feel my heart will overflow
[01:46.00:zh]有时爱意在心底快要满溢
[01:54.00]Hello  I've just got to let you know
[01:54.00:zh]你好，我一定要让你知晓
[02:01.00]'Cause I wonder where you are
[02:01.00:zh]我总想知道你身在何方
[02:05.00]And I wonder what you do
[02:05.00:zh]好奇你日常的点滴
[02:09.00]Are you somewhere feeling lonely  or is someone loving you
[02:09.00:zh]你是否孤身寂寞，还是已有他人爱你
[02:17.00]Tell me how to win your heart
[02:17.00:zh]请告诉我，怎样才能俘获你的心
[02:21.00]For I haven't got a clue
[02:21.00:zh]我毫无头绪，不知该怎么做
[02:25.00]But let me start by saying  I love you
[02:25.00:zh]那就先让我说出：我爱你
